OL,3,ADaniel Thomas to be sentenced for
OL,4,Aslashing dinghy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas,
OL,7,Falso known as Danny Tommo, is being
OL,8,Fsentenced for criminal damage
OL,10,FEarlier this month he admitted slashing
OL,11,Fa dinghy with a knife in the English
OL,12,FChannel in September
OL,14,FHe had been livestreaming on a boat
OL,15,Fwhile he observed the migrant occupants
OL,16,Fof the dinghy being taken off by the
OL,17,FRNLI, Border Force and the French
OL,18,FCoastguard
OL,20,FThomas then used a knife to slash holes
OL,21,Fin the dinghy, which had French
OL,22,Fpersonnel on board
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
